      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PARIAH FLYER (2) has returned in terrific order this campaign and is nearing another victory, only beaten a lip here last start. Gets in well again with a claimer engaged and only needs to hold her form to be there at the finish. LA STIAVA (6) return with a bang on the Acton when scoring with a fair bit in hand. Drawn sticky again but can overcome. JUNGLE LIGHTS (5) went one better here last start when scoring by a head to get off the mark. Still lightly raced and has more to offer. Can threaten. LORD OF VALOR (1) was a big improver here last start when leading pillar-to-post in testing conditions. Has been freshened with 50 days and keeps McDougall. Expect him to give another bold sight.",
